{
  "sn51.11:0.1": "Linked Discourses 51.11 ",
  "sn51.11:0.2": "2. Shaking the Stilt Longhouse ",
  "sn51.11:0.3": "Before ",
  "sn51.11:1.1": "At Sāvatthī. ",
  "sn51.11:1.2": "“Mendicants, before my awakening—when I was still unawakened but intent on awakening—I thought: ",
  "sn51.11:1.3": "‘What’s the cause, what’s the reason for the development of the bases of psychic power?’ ",
  "sn51.11:1.4": "Then it occurred to me: ",
  "sn51.11:1.5": "‘It’s when a mendicant develops the basis of psychic power that has immersion due to enthusiasm, and active effort. ",
  "sn51.11:1.6": "They think: “My enthusiasm won’t be too lax or too tense. And it’ll be neither constricted internally nor scattered externally.” ",
  "sn51.11:1.7": "And they meditate perceiving before and behind: ",
  "sn51.11:1.8": "as before, so behind; as behind, so before; ",
  "sn51.11:1.9": "as below, so above; as above, so below; ",
  "sn51.11:1.10": "as by day, so by night; as by night, so by day. ",
  "sn51.11:1.11": "And so, with an open and unenveloped heart, they develop a mind that’s full of radiance. ",
  "sn51.11:2.1": "They develop the basis of psychic power that has immersion due to energy … ",
  "sn51.11:2.2": "",
  "sn51.11:2.3": "",
  "sn51.11:2.4": "",
  "sn51.11:2.5": "",
  "sn51.11:2.6": "",
  "sn51.11:2.7": "",
  "sn51.11:3.1": "mental development … ",
